
## 📝 .gitignore

Certifique-se de ter um `.gitignore` na raiz:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Ambiente virtual
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# Django
*.log
*.pot
*.pyc
local_settings.py
db.sqlite3
media/
staticfiles/

# Docker
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# Backup
backups/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db